+All Godot processes are newly launched task fixtures. Each command runs in a fresh PowerShell process from the repository root. No owner process is restarted. APPDATA and LOCALAPPDATA point under build/memory-drift-2026-10-26. The final soak itself rejects a profile outside build/.
+
+Pinned engine:
