+Actual engine SHA256:
+ab1824f85bfd8e0e4128182c000c4003a3e042245b2967848d089b2a04b22424
+
+Common fixture setup (replace profile suffix per test, as recorded in logs):
+$env:APPDATA=Join-Path $PWD 'build/memory-drift-2026-10-26/profile-<fixture>'
+$env:LOCALAPPDATA=$env:APPDATA
+Remove-Item Env:BMT_API_URL -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
+
+Memory regression against original library, standalone project without autoloads:
+Godot --headless --audio-driver Dummy --path build/memory-drift-2026-10-26/baseline-project --script ../../../game/tests/test_native_blend_memory.gd -- --native-extension=../geometry-original.gdextension
+Expected retained result: 10 checks, 3 memory failures; 128 bytes per blend piece per call.
+
+Identical isolated control with fixed library:
+Godot --headless --audio-driver Dummy --path build/memory-drift-2026-10-26/baseline-project --script ../../../game/tests/test_native_blend_memory.gd -- --native-extension=../geometry-fixed.gdextension
+Result: 10 checks, 0 failures.
+
+Shipping-project regression:
+Godot --headless --audio-driver Dummy --path game --script tests/test_native_blend_memory.gd
+Result: 9 checks, 0 failures.
+
+The baseline-project/project.godot contains only config_version=5, application name BmtMemoryLab, and gl_compatibility renderer. Each geometry-*.gdextension uses entry_symbol bmt_track_geometry_init and an absolute Windows library path. Original SHA256: 41dbd9ca28a19778176d0b908e956fb3bcc95eb4f9d5c29f69b036bd397811d6. Fixed SHA256: 3ac2a06f796a88488112f80bcc7d224a5602f0ba7b6e418bcca8166c28ac3ef8.
+
+Owned diagnostic helper build (source retained in probes/heap_probe.cpp; use the corresponding v3/v4 descriptor expected by each probe):
+C:/msys64/mingw64/bin/g++.exe -std=c++17 -O2 -shared -DGDEXTENSION -DNDEBUG -I.tools/godot-cpp-music/include -I.tools/godot-cpp-music/gen/include -I.tools/godot-cpp-music/gdextension build/memory-drift-2026-10-26/heap_probe.cpp -static -DWINDOWS_ENABLED .tools/godot-cpp-music/bin/libgodot-cpp.windows.template_release.x86_64.a -o build/memory-drift-2026-10-26/heap_probe_v4.dll
