+Godot --headless --audio-driver Dummy --path game --script ../build/memory-drift-2026-10-26/dictionary_assignment_probe.gd
+Godot --headless --audio-driver Dummy --path game --script ../build/memory-drift-2026-10-26/heap_selftest.gd
