+(The original library was selected when this process started.)
+Godot --headless --audio-driver Dummy --path game --script ../build/memory-drift-2026-10-26/minimal_editor_fixed_probe.gd -- --cycles=20
+Godot --audio-driver Dummy --rendering-method gl_compatibility --path game --script ../build/memory-drift-2026-10-26/minimal_editor_fixed_probe.gd -- --cycles=20 --tag=editor-fixed-window
