+strip --strip-unneeded <owned-build-DLL>
+Copy under its SHA256-derived name and change only the descriptor's Windows library line. The original loaded DLL remains available.
+
+Native Android builds (both succeeded; no device execution):
+.tools/android-ndk-r28b/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/windows-x86_64/bin/clang++.exe -std=c++17 -O2 -g -ffp-contract=off -shared -DGDEXTENSION -DNDEBUG -I.tools/godot-cpp-music/include -I.tools/godot-cpp-music/gen/include -I.tools/godot-cpp-music/gdextension native/track_geometry/track_geometry.cpp --target=aarch64-linux-android24 --sysroot=<NDK>/sysroot -fPIC -DANDROID_ENABLED -DUNIX_ENABLED -Wl,--build-id=sha1 -Wl,-z,max-page-size=16384 -static-libstdc++ .tools/godot-cpp-music/bin/libgodot-cpp.android.template_release.arm64.a -llog -ldl -o build/memory-drift-2026-10-26/native/libbmt_track_geometry.android.arm64.so
+Equivalent x86_64 command substitutes --target=x86_64-linux-android24 and libgodot-cpp.android.template_release.x86_64.a.
+llvm-objcopy --only-keep-debug <owned-build-SO> <owned-build-SO>.debug
